      "title": "Apple and Anthropic reportedly partner to build an AI coding platform",
      "description": "",
      "summary": "Apple and Anthropic are teaming up to build a \"vibe-coding\" software platform that will use generative AI to write, edit, and test code for programmers, Bloomberg reported on Friday. The iPhone maker is planning to roll out the software internally, according to Bloomberg, but hasn't decided if it will launch it publicly. The system is a new version of Apple's programming software, Xcode, and relies on Anthropic's Claude Sonnet model, according to the report. To accelerate its AI efforts, Apple s",
