      "contentType": "VIDEO",
      "title": "Here's what top C-suites are saying about tariffs",
      "description": "<p>US President Trump's tariff policies have created a challenging environment for business leaders. Here's what some executives are saying about navigating tariffs, including CEOs from <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/coca-cola-ceo-talks-earnings-153006055.html\">Coca-Cola</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/KO\">KO</a>), <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/starbucks-ceo-turnaround-consumers-third-135354950.html\">Starbucks</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SBUX\">SBUX</a>), and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/astrazenecas-number-1-priority-us-141833772.html\">AstraZeneca</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AZN\">AZN</a>), and top executives at Meta (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/META\">META</a>), General Motors (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GM\">GM</a>), and Amazon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Wealth <a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/wealth/\">here</a>.</p>",
      "summary": "US President Trump's tariff policies have created a challenging environment for business leaders. Here's what some executives are saying about navigating tariffs, including CEOs from Coca-Cola (KO), Starbucks (SBUX), and AstraZeneca (AZN), and top executives at Meta (META), General Motors (GM), and Amazon (AMZN). To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Wealth here.",
