    "content": {
      "id": "377fa29a-ec0e-3575-8376-c091619eb3a6",
      "contentType": "VIDEO",
      "title": "US judge finds Apple to be in violation of antitrust order",
      "description": "<p>A federal judge found Apple (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AAPL\">AAPL</a>) <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/judge-says-ceo-tim-cook-chose-poorly-as-apple-ignored-app-store-order-174755382.html\">in violation of a 2021 court order</a> demanding the tech giant to enable broader competition for app developers and payment methods on its App Store.\u00a0</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance senior legal correspondent <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/alexis-keenan/\">Alexis Keenan</a> explains US District Judge Yvonne Gonzalez Rogers' ruling stemming from a 2021 antitrust case brought forth against Apple by Epic Games. She goes into detail on the judge's original injunction and accusations of an Apple executive lying under oath.</p>\n<p>Catch Yahoo Finance break down <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/apple-iphone-revenue-tops-estimates-204051176.html\">Apple's fiscal second quarter earnings results.</a></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination Overtime\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">here</a>.</p>",
      "summary": "A federal judge found Apple (AAPL) in violation of a 2021 court order demanding the tech giant to enable broader competition for app developers and payment methods on its App Store.&nbsp; Yahoo Finance senior legal correspondent Alexis Keenan explains US District Judge Yvonne Gonzalez Rogers' ruling stemming from a 2021 antitrust case brought forth against Apple by Epic Games. She goes into detail on the judge's original injunction and accusations of an Apple executive lying under oath. Catch Yahoo Finance break down Apple's fiscal second quarter earnings results. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination Overtime&nbsp;here.",
